  "description": "A bike capable of transforming every rider into the fastest version of themselves, delivering race-level performance to all.\n\n[From Latin « semper velocem »] meaning always fast : a philosophy where aerodynamics, lightness and handling are associated with comfort and adaptability capable of transforming every rider into the fastest version of themself.\n\nWithout the constraints of catering firstly to professional racing demands, we had the freedom to design a bike that prioritizes the needs of everyday riders who ride for passion, performance, and the sheer love of the sport. By collaborating with 4 Performance Bike Fit Studio and leveraging artificial intelligence, we gained deep insights into what riders truly value: comfort, fit, and speed.\n\nWhether you’re chasing your personal best, conquering challenging climbs, or simply savoring the joy of riding an Italian bike, the SV is engineered to elevate your cycling experience . This bike will transform every rider into the fastest version of themselves, delivering race-level performance to all.\n\nWe don’t just choose colors; we craft them . Every finish on the SV is designed to turn heads, inspire rides, and make a statement, because performance deserves to look as good as it feels.\n\n780g of carefully crafted carbon technology optimized for the lowest drag in the wind, designed to translate every pedal stroke in forward motion and to provide thrilling handling.\n\nAt Basso, we believe that performance is only as powerful as the comfort it provides. The SV redefines comfort in road cycling, integrating advanced geometry, innovative features, and ergonomic design to ensure that every ride feels as good as it performs.\n\nTo cater to the varied needs and preferences of riders, the SV offers two distinct cockpit options: Fuga and Levita.",
